cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the models it implements, please cite the papers."
title: "SCCD-X Engine — Sovereign-Civilian Capacity Dynamics, extended"
abstract: >-
  A qualitative structural engine for world politics. It implements Sovereign-
  Civilian Capacity Dynamics (sccd v1.00) and supplies its two exogenous ODE
  terms from two further papers: a demographic forcing block (The Wheel of Fate)
  and an AI-adoption forcing block (The Displacement Hypothesis). Ships a
  fully bilingual VI/EN interface and a worked eleven-polity ASEAN application.
authors:
  - family-names: "Vi"
    given-names: "Nhật Sơn"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - state capacity
  - political economy
  - system dynamics
  - fragility
  - demography
  - artificial intelligence
  - ASEAN
references:
